{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36828","headline":"寄酬邺王罗令公五首 一 · 罗隐","name":"寄酬邺王罗令公五首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"营室东回廕斥丘，少年承袭拥青油。\n坐调金鼎尊明主，横把琱戈拜列侯。\n书札二王争巧拙，篇章七子避风流。\n西园旧迹今应在，衰老无因奉胜游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36828.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36828","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}